   "extract": "Atlantis The Royal, Dubai is a hotel resort at the Palm Jumeirah, Dubai in the United Arab Emirates. The 760 room, 16 restaurant resort has the world's largest jellyfish aquarium. Out of the 102 VIP suites, 44 have their own private pools. Outdoor areas remain cooled 10 months out of the year using shades, pools, plants, and ornamental fountains. Atlantis the Royal is one of the most expensive hotels in the world, where the price of the \"Royal Mansion\" suite exceeds $100,000 per night.",
   "extract_html": "<p><b>Atlantis The Royal, Dubai</b> is a hotel resort at the Palm Jumeirah, Dubai in the United Arab Emirates. The 760 room, 16 restaurant resort has the world's largest jellyfish aquarium. Out of the 102 VIP suites, 44 have their own private pools. Outdoor areas remain cooled 10 months out of the year using shades, pools, plants, and ornamental fountains. Atlantis the Royal is one of the most expensive hotels in the world, where the price of the \"Royal Mansion\" suite exceeds $100,000 per night.</p>"
  }
